# --- Generated pilot evidence artifacts ---
# Pilot dumps are local generated evidence. Commit curated summaries elsewhere,
# or force-add a specific artifact only when intentionally preserving it.
reports/pilots/**
!reports/pilots/
!reports/pilots/README.md

